d out well*) e **turn into** (*Water turned into ice*) são os mais úteis em narrativas."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I ___ down a boring job. (turn, past)","a":"turned","why":"turn down."},{"s":"It ___ out to be the best decision. (turn, past)","a":"turned","why":"turn out."},{"s":"My side project ___ into a business. (turn, past)","a":"turned","why":"turn into."},{"s":"We ___ around the company. (turn, past)","a":"turned","why":"turn around."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["career turnaround","virada de carreira"],["declined offer","oferta recusada"],["mentor advice","conselho de mentor"],["side hustle","trabalho paralelo"],["business launch","lançamento de negócio"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["it","turn","out","How","did"],"ans":"How did it turn out","pt":"Como acabou?"},{"words":["boring","job","Did","you","take","the"],"ans":"Did you take the boring job","pt":"Você aceitou o emprego chato?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"career turnaround","pos":"word","pt":"virada de carreira","ex":"Career turnaround.","expt":"Virada de carreira."},{"w":"declined offer","pos":"word","pt":"oferta recusada","ex":"Declined offer.","expt":"Oferta recusada."},{"w":"mentor advice","pos":"word","pt":"conselho de mentor","ex":"Mentor advice.","expt":"Conselho de mentor."},{"w":"side hustle","pos":"word","pt":"trabalho paralelo","ex":"Side hustle.","expt":"Trabalho paralelo."},{"w":"business launch","pos":"word","pt":"lançamento de negócio","ex":"Business launch.","expt":"Lançamento de negócio."},{"w":"start-up founder","pos":"word","pt":"fundador de start-up","ex":"Start-up founder.","expt":"Fundador de start-up."},{"w":"market downturn","pos":"word","pt":"queda de mercado","ex":"Market downturn.","expt":"Queda de mercado."},{"w":"company recover